        <headline>Flash Flood Warning issued September 24 at 6:09PM MDT until September 24 at 6:15PM MDT by NWS El Paso Tx/Santa Teresa NM</headline>
        <description>Flood waters have receded but minor flooding may be ongoing. Please
continue to heed remaining road closures.

A Flood Watch remains in effect until 600 AM MDT Friday for a portion
of south central New Mexico.
